# ReviewSense

> An end-to-end customer sentiment intelligence platform powered by NLP, fine-tuned RoBERTa, and Streamlit analytics.

## Overview

**ReviewSense** is a customer feedback analytics platform that analyzes customer reviews and converts unstructured feedback into actionable sentiment insights.

The system uses a **fine-tuned RoBERTa transformer model** for three-class sentiment classification:

- Positive
- Neutral
- Negative

It also provides product-wise, brand-wise, and category-wise analytics through an interactive **Streamlit dashboard**.

---

## Key Features

- Customer review sentiment analysis
- Fine-tuned **RoBERTa** model
- Rating-based initial sentiment labeling
- Sentiment conflict detection between ratings and review text
- Manual validation of conflicting reviews
- Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-score evaluation
- Confidence scores for predictions
- Product-wise sentiment analysis
- Brand-wise performance analysis
- Category-wise sentiment analysis
- Sentiment trend analysis over time
- Keyword frequency extraction
- Interactive Streamlit dashboard
- Role-based authentication:
  - Admin
  - Customer

---

